    <textarea class="form-input md-input" data-md-input rows="9" aria-label="Markdown source">## Split delivery policy

Split an order into **two shipments** when _either_ condition holds:

- More than 20 lines are waiting for stock
- A `priority` flag is set on the customer

> Never split and change the carrier in the same decision.
